<includeonly>{{#invoke:CinderData|itemGrid|tab={{{tab|}}}}}</includeonly><noinclude>
A grid of cards linking to every item page in one creative tab, grouped by weapon type or slot and sorted by rarity.

Usage: <code><nowiki>{{ItemGrid|tab=cinderweaponry}}</nowiki></code>

The bot adds this to new pages. You do not need to change it; write your text around it. The data is read from the <code>Data:</code> pages and drawn by [[Module:CinderData]].

